ub.com/users/m-iancu","html_url":"https://github.com/m-iancu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"m-iancu","id":4038003,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMzgwMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4038003?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu","html_url":"https://github.com/m-iancu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2018-09-09T15:25:56Z","updated_at":"2018-09-17T07:38:33Z","closed_at":"2018-09-17T07:38:33Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"See the following [post ](https://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/pull/429#issuecomment-418178538)for details. The `testStaticColumns()` of `SimpleQueryTest.java` can be used to reproduce the below issue.\r\n```\r\n    createTable(\"CREATE TABLE %s (k text, t int, s text static, v text, PRIMARY KEY (k, t));\");\r\n    execute(\"INSERT INTO %s (k, t, v, s) values (?, ?, ?, ?)\", \"key1\", 1, \"foo1\", \"st1\");\r\n    execute(\"INSERT INTO %s (k, t, v, s) values (?, ?, ?, ?)\", \"key1\", 2, \"foo2\", \"st2\");\r\n    ....\r\n    assertRows(execute(\"SELECT * FROM %s WHERE k = ? AND t = ?\", \"key1\", 2),\r\n      row(\"key1\", 2, \"st5\", \"foo2\"));\r\n```\r\nThe above assert succeeds. But the below **SELECT with an ORDER BY is the issue**\r\n`    displayRows(execute(\"SELECT * FROM %s WHERE k = ? AND t = ? ORDER BY t DESC\", \"key1\", 2));`\r\n`Displays: Row 0 = Row[key1, 2, NULL, foo2]`\r\n\r\nSo the below assert fails since col2 is `NULL `instead of `st5`. Looks like `ORDER BY t DESC` handling in SELECT maybe causing the issue?\r\n```\r\n    assertRows(execute(\"SELECT * FROM %s WHERE k = ? AND t = ? ORDER BY t DESC\", \"key1\", 2),\r\n      row(\"key1\", 2, \"st5\", \"foo2\"));\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"m-iancu","id":4038003,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMzgwMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4038003?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu","html_url":"https://github.com/m-iancu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-iancu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/465/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}